        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Services](/services) · [Book](/book) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# Saltwater Hair Studio\n\nColour, cuts and blowouts in Saint-Jean, five minutes from the airport.\n\nFounded in 2017 by Emma Whitfield, a colourist trained in London, Saltwater is a small studio with three chairs and no rush.\n\n## Services\n\n| Service | Price |\n|---|---|\n| Women's cut and blow-dry | €70 |\n| Men's cut | €40 |\n| Blowout | €45 |\n| Full balayage | from €180 |\n| Root touch-up | €85 |\n| Olaplex treatment | €60 |\n| Bridal hair (trial included) | €250 |\n\n## Hours\n\nTuesday–Saturday, 9am–6pm. Closed Sunday and Monday.\n\nBook online: https://www.fresha.example/saltwater-hair-studio\n\n## Team\n\n- Emma Whitfield, owner and colourist\n- Léa Dumont, stylist\n- Jake Morris, barber\n\n\"Emma fixed a colour disaster from another salon and I've never looked back.\" — Hannah P.\n\nSaltwater Hair Studio, Centre Commercial La Savane, Saint-Jean 97133\n+590 590 00 26 78 · bookings@saltwaterhair.example\n\nWe speak English and French. Cards only, no cash.\n\n© Saltwater Hair Studio · Privacy · Cookies"
